          "text": "The amounts of money held by A, B and C are in the ratio 3:4:5. First, A gives one third of A’s original amount to B. Then C gives 20% of C’s original amount, shared equally between A and B. After both transfers, B has S$360 more than A. Find the original total amount of money, in dollars."
